      "content": "that's a good start. for the first actual segment though, i want to dive into something big. i want to talk about why everything is so expensive lately and how the people in charge seem to ignore the working class while they push these crazy globalist agendas. can you write a 2-minute monologue for the host that touches on how the \"expert\" class and big government are basically out of touch with what regular families actually need to survive?",
